      "source": "This annotation serves as a specialization of <a href=\"Component.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>,\nallowing for implementation classes to be autodetected through classpath scanning.\nIt is typically used in combination with annotated handler methods based on the\n<a href=\"../web/bind/annotation/RequestMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestMapping</code></a> annotation.",
